* 05-bjt-npn-generic.lib - generic small-signal NPN transistor
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.model NPN_GENERIC NPN(IS=6.734f XTI=3 EG=1.11 VAF=74.03 BF=416.4
* forward-region terms follow
+ NE=1.259 ISE=6.734f IKF=66.78m XTB=1.5 BR=.7371 NC=2 ISC=0 IKR=0 $ reverse terms
+ RC=1 CJC=3.638p MJC=.3085 VJC=.75 FC=.5 CJE=4.493p MJE=.2593 VJE=.75

+ TR=239.5n TF=301.2p ITF=.4 VTF=4 XTF=2 RB=10)
* end of NPN_GENERIC
